   "en": "pe",
   "html": "<p class=\"pz-kicker\">Punto estacionario a mano</p><h3 class=\"pz-t\">Derivar · igualar a 0 · resolver</h3><p class=\"pz-nota\" data-en=\"pe\">En la cima de una loma el terreno es plano: <strong>pendiente 0</strong> en todas las direcciones · <span data-en=\"pe-c\">como en cálculo</span></p><div class=\"pz-cols\"><div class=\"pz-col\"><div class=\"pz-f\" data-en=\"d1\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\hat y}{\\partial x_1}=b_1+2b_{11}x_1+b_{12}x_2=0$$</div><p class=\"pz-nota pz-mal\" data-en=\"d1-ojo\">El <strong>2</strong> sale de derivar x₁² · x₂ sale de derivar x₁x₂</p><div class=\"pz-f\" data-en=\"d2\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\hat y}{\\partial x_2}=b_2+b_{12}x_1+2b_{22}x_2=0$$</div></div><div class=\"pz-col\"><p data-en=\"sist\">Con los números del ejemplo:</p><div class=\"pz-f\" data-en=\"sist-1\">$$10{,}18-17\\,x_1-7{,}75\\,x_2=0$$</div><div class=\"pz-f\" data-en=\"sist-2\">$$4{,}216-7{,}75\\,x_1-10{,}5\\,x_2=0$$</div><div class=\"pz-f\" data-en=\"sol\">$$x_1^*=0{,}626\\qquad x_2^*=-0{,}061$$</div><div class=\"pz-f\" data-en=\"mat\">$$\\mathbf x_s=-\\tfrac12B^{-1}\\mathbf b,\\ \\ B=\\left(\\begin{smallmatrix}b_{11}&b_{12}/2\\\\b_{12}/2&b_{22}\\end{smallmatrix}\\right)$$</div></div></div>"
